00:23:03.482 --> 00:23:05.917
INTRODUCED AB 1122 LAST YEAR

00:23:05.984 --> 00:23:08.954
AFTER HEARING THAT THESE SAFETY

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:10.021
CONCERNS HAD BEEN IGNORED AND

00:23:10.088 --> 00:23:12.390
THE BILL BEFORE THE COMMITTEE

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:15.427
TODAY ENSURES THAT DPFS INCLUDE

00:23:15.494 --> 00:23:19.097
A BYPASS SYSTEM. THE BILL ALSO

00:23:19.164 --> 00:23:20.132
