00:23:20.198 --> 00:23:22.667
THAT APPLY ANY TIME THE BYPASS

00:23:22.734 --> 00:23:24.469
SYSTEM IS USED TO ENSURE WE

00:23:24.536 --> 00:23:26.271
UNDERSTAND WHAT EMERGENCY

00:23:26.338 --> 00:23:27.305
SITUATION CAUSED THE CAPTAIN TO

00:23:27.372 --> 00:23:30.041
ACTIVATE THE BYPASS AND HOW LONG

00:23:30.108 --> 00:23:31.943
THE BYPASS WAS IN USE, AND HOW

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.979
THE BYPASS HELPED MITIGATE THE

00:23:34.045 --> 00:23:36.414
EMERGENCY. SO THERE IS AN OVER

00:23:36.481 --> 00:23:39.951
ABUSE OF THIS SYSTEM. THE OTHER

00:23:40.018 --> 00:23:41.019
