00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.325
INSPECTION WITH THE REQUIREMENT

00:24:20.392 --> 00:24:21.493
TO INSTALL NEW ENGINES, ALLOWING

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:24.563
ALLOWING FOR. THIS ALIGNMENT

